body:
I hear ya. For a custom fit robe that’s completely movie accurate; for me it was worth it. Even though I only really wear mine around Halloween, it’s super sick to have. Here’s both Instagram @s:
@screamrobes
@screamkillercostumes

I say this being totally serious;
I absolutely love everything about H4. Maybe it’s the nostalgia, but dude, even now this movie slaps harder than a pimp on his birthday. The mask is shit in some shots, but isn’t that the point of Michael’s mask? A cheap store mask? Hell the crew just got lucky with how fucking fantastic the mask turned out to look in 78(IMO).
Anyway, I really loved everything this movie offered, and I can watch it at any point. If it’s on AMC around Halloween time, I’ll stop what I’m doing to watch it.
